'''Mansaka''' (Mansaka: '''Minansaka'''<ref name="e18" />) is an [[Austronesian languages|Austronesian]] language of [[Mindanao]] in the [[Philippines]]. It may be intelligible with [[Mandaya language|Mandaya]].

Mansaka is spoken in western [[Baganga]], and into central-west [[Davao de Oro]] province, continuing south back into [[Davao Oriental]] Province as far south as [[Pujada Bay]].<ref name=e18/>

